# ============================================================
# YOLO / ML Models
#
# The kiosk model IS committed on purpose. The browser fetches
# /models/uniform_yolo11n.onnx at runtime, so if it is missing from the repo
# the deployed kiosk silently loses dress-code detection — it still matches
# faces, it just fails every uniform check with no obvious cause.
# The base weights (*.pt) stay out: they are 5.6 MB and only needed to retrain.
# ============================================================
*.pt
*.onnx
!services/kiosk/public/models/*.onnx
*.engine
*.zip
Uniform_left/

runs/
!services/kiosk/training/dataset/
!services/kiosk/training/runs/

# Training dataset — 43 MB of Roboflow images, needed only to RETRAIN, never to
# run or deploy. Re-download from the url in uniform/data.yaml. Delete these
# four lines if you want the raw images in the repo.
uniform/train/
uniform/valid/
uniform/test/

# ============================================================
# Misc
# ============================================================
nul
